    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/6b93b11599b9812b9abdcf58e6bc137e.poster.avif?t=1728498686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/6b93b11599b9812b9abdcf58e6bc137e.webm?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/6b93b11599b9812b9abdcf58e6bc137e.mp4?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This town is full of familiar people whose faces cannot be remembered. Full of familiar streets and yards that never end. But you look like you\u2019ve been here before - you do look familiar. You had to deliver that letter, but something went wrong with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/40a55fe134f536a274564923a79a4d0b.poster.avif?t=1728498686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/40a55fe134f536a274564923a79a4d0b.webm?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/40a55fe134f536a274564923a79a4d0b.mp4?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, you are not an outsider - these walls belong to you in the exact same way you belong to them. Those streets are full of dead ends, waiting for you to explore all of them. They all harbor some secrets for you... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/d5583c446c6cd7559ce73b1f2b347c3f.poster.avif?t=1728498686\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/d5583c446c6cd7559ce73b1f2b347c3f.webp?t=1728498686\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The available demo is a very short 5 to 10 mins teaser to show you the vibe and give some hints about storytelling and story direction. If I could, I would replace any &quot;demo&quot; words from the Steam page with &quot;playable experience&quot;.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/6b93b11599b9812b9abdcf58e6bc137e.poster.avif?t=1728498686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/6b93b11599b9812b9abdcf58e6bc137e.webm?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/6b93b11599b9812b9abdcf58e6bc137e.mp4?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This town is full of familiar people whose faces cannot be remembered. Full of familiar streets and yards that never end. But you look like you\u2019ve been here before - you do look familiar. You had to deliver that letter, but something went wrong with it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/40a55fe134f536a274564923a79a4d0b.poster.avif?t=1728498686\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/40a55fe134f536a274564923a79a4d0b.webm?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/40a55fe134f536a274564923a79a4d0b.mp4?t=1728498686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Remember, you are not an outsider - these walls belong to you in the exact same way you belong to them. Those streets are full of dead ends, waiting for you to explore all of them. They all harbor some secrets for you... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/d5583c446c6cd7559ce73b1f2b347c3f.poster.avif?t=1728498686\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1684460/extras/d5583c446c6cd7559ce73b1f2b347c3f.webp?t=1728498686\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The available demo is a very short 5 to 10 mins teaser to show you the vibe and give some hints about storytelling and story direction. If I could, I would replace any &quot;demo&quot; words from the Steam page with &quot;playable experience&quot;.</p>",
